22
00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:05.100
You guys feeling good about that nod that you so deserve?

23
00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:08.525
We were so excited to have you Drew.

24
00:01:08.525 --> 00:01:11.384
(audience clapping)

25
00:01:11.384 --> 00:01:13.530
And I am so happy, we are all very happy

26
00:01:13.530 --> 00:01:15.540
