75
00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:33.455
And all of us who are your fans...

76
00:03:33.455 --> 00:03:35.940
(audience clapping)

77
00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:37.580
Okay, I'm seeing in the prompter.

78
00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:38.943
There's a surprise for me.

79
00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:41.403
Oh God.

80
00:03:41.403 --> 00:03:43.510
Drew, we love you so much,

81
00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:46.270 line:15%
